      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Jack, thanks for the comment.\n\nAbout the async issue, I thought it would not make much difference since the API is already asynchronous - the IBluetoothLeCallControl is oneway (https://source.corp.google.com/aosp-master/packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/binder/android/bluetooth/IBluetoothLeCallControl.aidl;l\u003d28).",
